  ('m','Which can be demanded in court immediately?','Fundamental Rights','Directive Principles','Preamble goals','Fundamental Rights are enforceable.'),
  ('m','Fundamental Duties were added in','1976','1950','1992','Part IV-A was added in 1976.'),
